asr-000167
00:28:03.350 --> 00:28:07.210
DILG Video Narrator: and boosting economic development among LGUs.

asr-000168
00:28:07.990 --> 00:28:14.970
DILG Video Narrator: The department likewise played a pivotal role in making our LGUs adequately prepared,

asr-000169
00:28:15.550 --> 00:28:19.330
DILG Video Narrator: which cushioned the impact of typhoons and other calamities

asr-000170
00:28:19.330 --> 00:28:21.910
DILG Video Narrator: that hit the various parts of the country.

asr-000171
00:28:22.330 --> 00:28:24.910
DILG Video Narrator: These include the constant monitoring of evacuations,

asr-000172
00:28:25.710 --> 00:28:27.670
DILG Video Narrator: evacuation centers in LGUs,

asr-000173
00:28:28.010 --> 00:28:33.510
DILG Video Narrator: as well as the timely and strategic deployment of first responders in affected areas

asr-000174
00:28:33.510 --> 00:28:38.010
DILG Video Narrator: to provide immediate assistance during and after disasters.

asr-000175
00:28:38.790 --> 00:28:45.140
DILG Video Narrator: We also monitored the completion of rehabilitated and constructed facilities

asr-000176
00:28:45.140 --> 00:28:48.900
DILG Video Narrator: and maintained the cleanliness of barangays and communities

asr-000177
00:28:48.900 --> 00:28:52.420
DILG Video Narrator: to help prevent further risks to public health.

asr-000178
00:28:56.100 --> 00:28:59.080
DILG Video Narrator: Uplifting the lives and welfare of every Filipino

asr-000179
00:28:59.900 --> 00:29:03.900
DILG Video Narrator: has been the driving force behind our sectoral interventions.

asr-000180
00:29:04.900 --> 00:29:09.900
DILG Video Narrator: We advanced the institutionalization of early childhood care and development

asr-000181
00:29:09.900 --> 00:29:15.900
DILG Video Narrator: while investing in the capacity and potential of the next generation of Filipinos.

asr-000182
00:29:16.900 --> 00:29:20.900
DILG Video Narrator: We also continued to address the needs of our Muslim brethren

asr-000183
00:29:20.900 --> 00:29:25.900
DILG Video Narrator: while strengthening our efforts in advancing gender equality in the country

asr-000184
00:29:25.900 --> 00:29:28.900
DILG Video Narrator: that are at par with or even better than those of others.

asr-000185
00:29:29.900 --> 00:29:33.900
DILG Video Narrator: In addition, we have been working with other countries in Asia and across the globe.

asr-000186
00:29:34.900 --> 00:29:37.900
DILG Video Narrator: These and much more have been made possible

asr-000187
00:29:37.900 --> 00:29:42.900
DILG Video Narrator: as reflected in our strong financial performance in 2025

asr-000188
00:29:42.900 --> 00:29:51.220
DILG Video Narrator: with a 96% obligation rate and a 95% disbursement rate.

asr-000189
00:29:51.220 --> 00:29:57.220
DILG Video Narrator: Similarly, we remain on track to achieve our financial targets for the year

asr-000190
00:29:57.220 --> 00:29:59.820
DILG Video Narrator: with a 55% obligation rate and a

asr-000191
00:29:59.820 --> 00:30:07.370
DILG Video Narrator: nearly 97% disbursement rate as of mid-year.

asr-000192
00:30:07.370 --> 00:30:14.390
DILG Video Narrator: Our proposal for the next fiscal year reflects our commitment to sustaining our ongoing initiatives

asr-000193
00:30:14.390 --> 00:30:24.770
DILG Video Narrator: and advancing our goals, amounting to a total of P332.5 billion, a 7% increase from last

asr-000194
00:30:24.770 --> 00:30:28.130
DILG Video Narrator: year's appropriation.

asr-000195
00:30:28.130 --> 00:30:35.170
DILG Video Narrator: Of this amount, Bureau of Jail Management and Penology, Bureau of Fire Protection, Philippine

asr-000196
00:30:35.170 --> 00:30:41.770
DILG Video Narrator: National Police, and the Office of the Secretary have registered increases in their respective

asr-000197
00:30:41.770 --> 00:30:43.470
DILG Video Narrator: appropriations.

asr-000198
00:30:43.470 --> 00:30:49.770
DILG Video Narrator: While the Early Childhood Care and Development Council, Philippine Commission on Women, National

asr-000199
00:30:49.770 --> 00:30:56.210
DILG Video Narrator: Commission on Muslim Filipinos, National Youth Commission, and National Police Commission

asr-000200
00:30:56.210 --> 00:30:58.110
DILG Video Narrator: have experienced decreases.

asr-000201
00:30:58.110 --> 00:31:02.590
DILG Video Narrator: Compared with their previous appropriations.

asr-000202
00:31:02.590 --> 00:31:09.710
DILG Video Narrator: Consistent with the previous years, the majority of our proposed budget, equivalent to 84%,

asr-000203
00:31:09.710 --> 00:31:17.250
DILG Video Narrator: is allocated to personal services, while 13% is earmarked for maintenance and other operating

asr-000204
00:31:17.250 --> 00:31:23.270
DILG Video Narrator: expenses and 3% for capital outlay.

asr-000205
00:31:23.270 --> 00:31:25.150
DILG Video Narrator: The proposed budget is broken down by

asr-000206
00:31:25.150 --> 00:31:26.150
DILG Video Narrator: expense class per agency.

asr-000213
00:31:33.960 --> 00:31:37.600
DILG Video Narrator: With your help, we will be able to build on these gains through the proposals each agency

asr-000214
00:31:37.600 --> 00:31:42.590
DILG Video Narrator: has put forward for your consideration.

asr-000215
00:31:42.590 --> 00:31:49.070
DILG Video Narrator: The Office of the Secretary will continue to uplift local governance in every community

asr-000216
00:31:49.070 --> 00:31:55.750
DILG Video Narrator: through the implementation of various programs and projects that strengthen LGU capacity,

asr-000217
00:31:55.750 --> 00:31:59.850
DILG Video Narrator: hasten implementation of development programs, advance digitalization, and improve the quality

asr-000218
00:31:59.850 --> 00:32:00.850
DILG Video Narrator: good governance,

asr-000219
00:32:01.370 --> 00:32:02.370
DILG Video Narrator: and citizen

asr-000220
00:32:02.370 --> 00:32:02.870
DILG Video Narrator: participation.

asr-000221
00:32:02.870 --> 00:32:04.510
DILG Video Narrator: We will remain unwavering

asr-000222
00:32:04.510 --> 00:32:05.430
DILG Video Narrator: in improving our emergency

asr-000223
00:32:05.430 --> 00:32:07.130
DILG Video Narrator: response system to make it

asr-000224
00:32:07.130 --> 00:32:09.910
DILG Video Narrator: more efficient and accessible

asr-000225
00:32:09.910 --> 00:32:24.210
DILG Video Narrator: while strengthening the fight against illegal drugs and advancing peace and order in the communities.

asr-000226
00:32:24.210 --> 00:32:29.210
DILG Video Narrator: Our drive continues to focus on the rehabilitation and cleanup of Manila

asr-000227
00:32:29.210 --> 00:32:30.210
DILG Video Narrator: Bay, strengthening

asr-000228
00:32:30.210 --> 00:32:31.210
DILG Video Narrator: disaster response

asr-000229
00:32:31.210 --> 00:32:38.510
DILG Video Narrator: and preparedness, enhancing the department's ICT capabilities, and fully operationalizing

asr-000230
00:32:38.510 --> 00:32:49.640
DILG Video Narrator: our new central office and regional offices. The LGA will continue to strengthen LGUs and

asr-000231
00:32:49.640 --> 00:32:56.980
DILG Video Narrator: the DILG personnel through training newly elected barangay officials, advancing disaster readiness,

asr-000232
00:32:56.980 --> 00:33:05.260
DILG Video Narrator: innovation, creative industries, and security, and strengthening their capacity to deliver these

asr-000233
00:33:05.260 --> 00:33:14.800
DILG Video Narrator: interventions. To uphold integrity and trust in our police force, the NAPOLCOM will prioritize

asr-000234
00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:22.520
DILG Video Narrator: investments in critical facilities in Regions 3, 5, and Cordillera Administrative Region,

asr-000235
00:33:22.520 --> 00:33:28.920
DILG Video Narrator: ICT projects, ISO certification, and equipment for Negros Island Region.

asr-000236
00:33:29.060 --> 00:33:38.010
DILG Video Narrator: The Philippine National Police will strengthen its ranks to become a reliable and trustworthy

asr-000237
00:33:38.010 --> 00:33:45.810
DILG Video Narrator: partner in law enforcement through the recruitment of new personnel, enhanced equipment and ICT

asr-000238
00:33:45.810 --> 00:33:55.100
DILG Video Narrator: capabilities, and stronger support for the welfare of its personnel. This will also include

asr-000239
00:33:55.100 --> 00:34:00.740
DILG Video Narrator: fulfilling commitments under the Program Convergence Initiatives, intensifying police

asr-000240
00:34:00.740 --> 00:34:03.760
DILG Video Narrator: operations, and constructing new facilities.

asr-000241
00:34:03.920 --> 00:34:12.360
DILG Video Narrator: The Bureau of Fire Protection will likewise accelerate efforts in fire prevention,

asr-000242
00:34:12.360 --> 00:34:19.740
DILG Video Narrator: suppression, and emergency response through hiring new fire officers, operationalizing newly

asr-000243
00:34:19.740 --> 00:34:26.440
DILG Video Narrator: completed fire stations, deploying new fire trucks, procuring equipment, and constructing

asr-000244
00:34:26.440 --> 00:34:36.980
DILG Video Narrator: new fire stations, training centers, and a fire arson laboratory. To safeguard and rehabilitate

asr-000245
00:34:36.980 --> 00:34:38.660
DILG Video Narrator: To safeguard and rehabilitate

asr-000248
00:34:39.200 --> 00:34:43.700
DILG Video Narrator: persons deprived of liberty, the Bureau of Jail Management and Penology will bring in

asr-000249
00:34:43.700 --> 00:34:51.260
DILG Video Narrator: recruits to reinforce operational capability and ensure hygiene and medical support.

asr-000250
00:34:51.260 --> 00:34:59.020
DILG Video Narrator: It will also counter illegal drugs in our jails, procure new firearms, radios, and vans,

asr-000251
00:34:59.020 --> 00:35:08.580
DILG Video Narrator: and construct new jail facilities in Calabarzon, molding the minds of our future public order

asr-000252
00:35:08.580 --> 00:35:10.320
DILG Video Narrator: and safety leaders.

asr-000253
00:35:10.320 --> 00:35:11.300
DILG Video Narrator: order and safety leaders, the Philippine

asr-000254
00:35:11.300 --> 00:35:16.020
DILG Video Narrator: Public Safety College will continue its education and training programs,

asr-000255
00:35:16.020 --> 00:35:21.700
DILG Video Narrator: research and curriculum development, while undertaking the construction of facilities

asr-000256
00:35:21.700 --> 00:35:30.820
DILG Video Narrator: and procurement of PPEs and ICT equipment. The National Youth Commission will lead the

asr-000257
00:35:30.820 --> 00:35:36.480
DILG Video Narrator: charge in empowering the Filipino leaders of tomorrow through mandatory and continuing

asr-000258
00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:43.300
DILG Video Narrator: training for Sangguniang Kabataan, participation in youth-oriented programs and activities,

asr-000259
00:35:43.300 --> 00:35:49.260
DILG Video Narrator: and support for anti-bullying and youth health initiatives.

asr-000260
00:35:49.260 --> 00:35:55.660
DILG Video Narrator: The National Commission on Muslim Filipinos includes moonsighting activities for Idil

asr-000261
00:35:55.660 --> 00:36:02.340
DILG Video Narrator: Adha and Idil Fitir, the administration and supervision of Hajj operations, strengthening

asr-000262
00:36:02.340 --> 00:36:10.900
DILG Video Narrator: Madaris and Islamic studies, supporting Muslim MSMEs, providing legal and paralegal assistance,

asr-000263
00:36:10.900 --> 00:36:12.100
DILG Video Narrator: and promoting peace-building and dialogue

asr-000264
00:36:12.100 --> 00:36:13.100
DILG Video Narrator: in

asr-000265
00:36:13.100 --> 00:36:14.100
DILG Video Narrator: Muslim

asr-000266
00:36:14.100 --> 00:36:15.800
DILG Video Narrator: Filipino

asr-000267
00:36:15.800 --> 00:36:17.100
DILG Video Narrator: communities.

asr-000269
00:36:18.100 --> 00:36:23.920
DILG Video Narrator: Championing the causes of women and girls, the Philippine Commission on Women will expand

asr-000270
00:36:23.920 --> 00:36:29.780
DILG Video Narrator: its reach in the Visayas while sustaining its initiatives on gender and development.

asr-000271
00:36:29.780 --> 00:36:37.980
DILG Video Narrator: Lastly, the Early Childhood Care and Development Council will intensify its efforts to give

asr-000272
00:36:37.980 --> 00:36:41.340
DILG Video Narrator: every child a stronger start by capacitating intermediaries

asr-000273
00:36:41.340 --> 00:36:42.340
DILG Video Narrator: intermediaries and

asr-000274
00:36:42.340 --> 00:36:43.100
DILG Video Narrator: partners,

asr-000275
00:36:43.100 --> 00:36:51.100
DILG Video Narrator: ensuring accreditation of ECCD service providers and monitoring child development centers.

asr-000276
00:36:51.100 --> 00:37:00.950
DILG Video Narrator: We will continue to stand firm and unwavering in serving the interests of the Filipino people

asr-000277
00:37:00.950 --> 00:37:09.950
DILG Video Narrator: and in carrying forward our commitment to building a nation that embodies the ideals of a Bagong Pilipinas.

asr-000278
00:37:09.950 --> 00:37:12.950
DILG Video Narrator: Thank you very much.

asr-000279
00:37:12.950 --> 00:37:22.890
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Any other presentation?

asr-000280
00:37:22.890 --> 00:37:28.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: No, no other, sir.

asr-000281
00:37:28.220 --> 00:37:35.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay. So we are also joined by the Senate President, Sherwin Gatchalian.

asr-000282
00:37:35.220 --> 00:37:37.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Good afternoon, sir.

asr-000283
00:37:37.220 --> 00:37:48.780
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So we will recognize first the Senate President Pro Tempore, Tito Sotto, because he arrived.

asr-000284
00:37:48.780 --> 00:37:56.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Second level, Your Honor.

asr-000285
00:37:56.020 --> 00:37:58.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Might as well give the floor to that.

asr-000286
00:37:58.020 --> 00:38:06.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Chairman of Finance and the Senate President before my questions.

asr-000287
00:38:06.020 --> 00:38:08.020
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Thank you.

asr-000288
00:38:08.020 --> 00:38:10.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Senate President.

asr-000289
00:38:10.020 --> 00:38:22.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Chairman, I know I arrived the latest, so I'll give way to the one who came in earlier, Mr. President.

asr-000290
00:38:22.020 --> 00:38:27.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Of course, the Senate President should be here now.

asr-000291
00:38:27.020 --> 00:38:28.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Should go ahead.

asr-000292
00:38:28.020 --> 00:38:29.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But anyway, thank you.

asr-000293
00:38:29.020 --> 00:38:37.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm just a few questions with that DILG and then probably later on with the PNP.

asr-000294
00:38:37.020 --> 00:38:42.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For fiscal year 2027, the DILG will receive additional 22 billion.

asr-000295
00:38:42.020 --> 00:38:52.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It's law enforcement agencies, namely the PNP, BFP, and BJMP, will also receive additional funding for the Office of the Secretary OSEC.

asr-000296
00:38:52.020 --> 00:38:55.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: An additional amount of 505.8 million will be allocated for 2027.

asr-000297
00:38:55.020 --> 00:38:58.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, of course, just a basic question.

asr-000298
00:38:58.020 --> 00:39:07.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For the additional 22 billion that the DILG will receive, including the agencies, what services can we expect?

asr-000299
00:39:07.020 --> 00:39:12.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What services can we expect? Ano pong serbisyo pagdating sa kaligtasan ng komunidad

asr-000300
00:39:12.020 --> 00:39:20.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang maramdaman ng ating mga kababayan? Lalo ngayon, siguro i-dagdag ko na rin,

asr-000301
00:39:20.020 --> 00:39:21.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kung meron ba

asr-000302
00:39:21.020 --> 00:39:22.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tayong malinaw

asr-000303
00:39:22.020 --> 00:39:23.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na plano o

asr-000304
00:39:23.020 --> 00:39:36.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: convergence sa mga ahensya tulad ng DILG, DepEd, LGUs, PNP, upang matugunan yung nangyaring insidente sa ating mga paaralan, yung mga shooting.

asr-000305
00:39:36.020 --> 00:39:38.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So siguro yun,

asr-000306
00:39:38.020 --> 00:39:39.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Secretary,

asr-000307
00:39:39.020 --> 00:39:41.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much.

asr-000308
00:39:41.020 --> 00:39:47.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Regarding the last issue, we are now initiating talks with the developers of Roblox.

asr-000309
00:39:47.020 --> 00:39:52.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The game, the games that the young children in conflict of the land play.

asr-000310
00:39:52.020 --> 00:39:56.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in conflict of the law, have been influenced by.

asr-000311
00:39:56.200 --> 00:39:59.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We are moving and requesting the NTC

asr-000312
00:39:59.140 --> 00:40:04.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to formally remove the access of the children from these games

asr-000313
00:40:04.020 --> 00:40:08.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because it has a very insidious chat box

asr-000314
00:40:08.920 --> 00:40:12.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: at the side of the games, where the children are induced

asr-000315
00:40:12.760 --> 00:40:14.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to commit violent crimes.

asr-000316
00:40:14.900 --> 00:40:19.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So in both cases, in Zamboanga and in Tacloban,

asr-000317
00:40:19.120 --> 00:40:22.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: both CICLs were influenced heavily

asr-000318
00:40:22.240 --> 00:40:24.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: by the games that they played.

asr-000319
00:40:24.820 --> 00:40:27.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That is a common denominator between the two of them.

asr-000320
00:40:27.740 --> 00:40:32.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In other aspects, we continue to have a faster response time

asr-000321
00:40:32.860 --> 00:40:36.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: through the unified 911.

asr-000322
00:40:36.460 --> 00:40:39.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The unified 911, in one year of operation,

asr-000323
00:40:39.100 --> 00:40:41.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: received over 2 million calls.

asr-000324
00:40:41.480 --> 00:40:43.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's around 60,000 calls a day.

asr-000325
00:40:43.880 --> 00:40:46.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And our response time is between three to seven minutes.

asr-000326
00:40:49.120 --> 00:40:53.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Noteworthy also is the drive of the PNP

asr-000327
00:40:53.140 --> 00:40:55.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in making the city safer.

asr-000328
00:40:55.060 --> 00:40:59.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There has been a significant drop in crimes in double digits,

asr-000329
00:40:59.500 --> 00:41:04.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: especially in the field of physical injury.

asr-000330
00:41:04.480 --> 00:41:06.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And rape has gone down dramatically

asr-000331
00:41:06.700 --> 00:41:08.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: over this past year.

asr-000332
00:41:08.420 --> 00:41:13.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we continue with our mandate.

asr-000333
00:41:13.480 --> 00:41:16.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And if there are any other questions,

asr-000334
00:41:16.240 --> 00:41:17.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we're open to answer.

asr-000335
00:41:17.860 --> 00:41:18.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, CIC.

asr-000336
00:41:19.120 --> 00:41:21.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You mentioned the 911, right?

asr-000337
00:41:21.120 --> 00:41:22.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes.

asr-000338
00:41:22.120 --> 00:41:26.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At least it's operational, it's being used.

asr-000339
00:41:26.360 --> 00:41:28.500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: This is one of the locally funded projects

asr-000340
