Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for the project, while under 2027 NEP,

asr-000343
00:41:39.060 --> 00:41:45.020
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: there will be an allocation of 299.272 million.

asr-000344
00:41:45.020 --> 00:41:47.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So with what is happening,

asr-000345
00:41:47.980 --> 00:41:48.440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: what?

asr-000346
00:41:48.440 --> 00:41:48.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What?

asr-000347
00:41:49.140 --> 00:41:50.940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: What?

asr-000348
00:41:50.940 --> 00:41:55.300
