01:35:36.980 --> 01:35:39.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And ang nangyayari kasi,

asr-001378
01:35:39.180 --> 01:35:40.560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: we found out last year

asr-001379
01:35:40.560 --> 01:35:43.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: nung nag-budgeteering tayo

asr-001380
01:35:43.220 --> 01:35:47.220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na nagkoconstruct yung DPWH,

asr-001381
01:35:47.220 --> 01:35:49.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: more often than not,

asr-001382
01:35:49.100 --> 01:35:50.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: hindi alam ng PNP

asr-001383
01:35:50.180 --> 01:35:52.700
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na nagkoconstruct sila.

asr-001384
01:35:52.700 --> 01:35:55.260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Walang coordination on the ground.

asr-001385
01:35:55.260 --> 01:35:56.860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung natapos naman,

asr-001386
01:35:56.860 --> 01:35:59.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: hindi nai-inform yung PNP.

asr-001387
01:35:59.140 --> 01:36:00.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Or kung hindi natapos,

asr-001388
01:36:00.140 --> 01:36:01.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: hindi rin nai-inform yung PNP.

asr-001389
01:36:01.940 --> 01:36:03.820
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So yung project na hahang,

asr-001390
01:36:03.940 --> 01:36:09.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: may we get an update on this TICAS?

asr-001391
01:36:09.180 --> 01:36:11.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Because ang chain of thought natin

asr-001392
01:36:11.180 --> 01:36:15.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: is let the PNP bid out

asr-001393
01:36:15.180 --> 01:36:19.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and construct infrastructure projects themselves.

asr-001394
01:36:19.180 --> 01:36:23.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi pag tinitignan namin itong mga projects nila,

asr-001395
01:36:23.180 --> 01:36:27.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: mostly mga nasa iba't ibang kampo

asr-001396
01:36:27.180 --> 01:36:31.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: at iba't ibang PNP facilities all over the nation.

asr-001397
01:36:31.180 --> 01:36:33.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So may we get an update dito po,

asr-001398
01:36:33.780 --> 01:36:37.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sa 8.9 billion

asr-001399
01:36:37.020 --> 01:36:40.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: on TICAS PNP projects.

asr-001400
01:36:40.020 --> 01:36:41.780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kung merong resolution dito ho

asr-001401
01:36:41.780 --> 01:36:45.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: at na-reconcile with the DPWH.

asr-001402
01:36:45.020 --> 01:36:49.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-001403
01:36:49.420 --> 01:36:50.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Upon my assumption,

asr-001404
01:36:50.420 --> 01:36:56.940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: I already accounted or asked the different units in the PNP

asr-001405
01:36:56.940 --> 01:36:58.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: to account all of the projects

asr-001406
01:36:58.420 --> 01:36:59.940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: that are covered with TICAS

asr-001407
01:36:59.940 --> 01:37:04.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and or the convergence project, convergence project,

asr-001408
01:37:04.420 --> 01:37:07.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: convergence plans through the DPWH,

asr-001409
01:37:07.420 --> 01:37:10.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: being implemented by the DPWH.

asr-001410
01:37:10.420 --> 01:37:14.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: It's true that we have requested those projects,

asr-001411
01:37:14.420 --> 01:37:20.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: but those projects are being implemented by the DPWH,

asr-001412
01:37:20.420 --> 01:37:22.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: especially the DPWH.

asr-001413
01:37:22.420 --> 01:37:24.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And so we have the data,

asr-001414
01:37:24.420 --> 01:37:28.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: we have the corresponding inspection of those projects,

asr-001415
01:37:28.420 --> 01:37:30.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: particularly constructions.

asr-001416
01:37:30.420 --> 01:37:32.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And we made it clear that,

asr-001417
01:37:32.420 --> 01:37:33.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: pagkakataon,

asr-001418
01:37:33.420 --> 01:37:34.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: pagkakataon,

asr-001419
01:37:34.420 --> 01:37:36.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: pagka hindi natapos yung project,

asr-001420
01:37:36.420 --> 01:37:37.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ay hindi namin nina-accept

asr-001421
01:37:37.420 --> 01:37:41.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and we readily coordinate with the DPWH.

asr-001422
01:37:41.420 --> 01:37:43.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And we have accounting of such projects,

asr-001423
01:37:43.420 --> 01:37:46.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-001424
01:37:46.420 --> 01:37:47.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Chief PNP,

asr-001425
01:37:47.420 --> 01:37:48.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: last year,

asr-001426
01:37:48.420 --> 01:37:52.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: linagay na namin yung TICAS projects sa PNP themselves.

asr-001427
01:37:52.420 --> 01:37:54.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pareho rin with AFP.

asr-001428
01:37:54.420 --> 01:37:57.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Linagay namin yung mga TICAS projects,

asr-001429
01:37:57.420 --> 01:38:00.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kasi ang TICAS, dalawa yan eh, AFP and PNP.

asr-001430
01:38:00.420 --> 01:38:03.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Linagay namin sa AFP and sa PNP.

asr-001431
01:38:03.420 --> 01:38:16.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: PNP. Dito sa paglalagay sa PNP, is this an effective direction so that PNP na ngayon

asr-001432
01:38:16.960 --> 01:38:22.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: magpapabid out kayo kung kailangan ipabid out at kayo na rin magkoconstruct. Of course,

asr-001433
01:38:22.500 --> 01:38:27.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: kayo na rin mag-accept ng project kung tingin nyo tama. Because we're talking about

asr-001434
01:38:27.460 --> 01:38:34.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: easily, we're talking about in a year, mga 3 to 5 billion rin ito. So, we want to know,

asr-001435
01:38:34.620 --> 01:38:40.920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: first time na tinransfer to sa PNP, we want to know from the standpoint of PNP kung ganitong

asr-001436
01:38:40.920 --> 01:38:48.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: pag-transfer sa PNP, effective ba o mas prefer nyo pa rin sa DPWH?

asr-001437
01:38:50.280 --> 01:38:56.460
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, mas effective pag nandito sa kung sino yung magbe-benefit. It's for accountability,

asr-001438
01:38:56.460 --> 01:38:57.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor.

asr-001439
01:38:57.460 --> 01:39:09.380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, I understand from our budget officer na ibinalik ulit sa DPWH, we'll transfer again itong mga items

asr-001440
01:39:09.380 --> 01:39:16.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: with the permission, of course, of our finance chair to the PNP para po mas mabilis yung projects.

asr-001441
01:39:17.200 --> 01:39:24.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kumusta ho yung tinransfer namin ng mga projects? Na-implement na ba ho sila this 2026?

asr-001442
01:39:25.500 --> 01:39:27.440
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Your Honor. It is being implemented.

asr-001443
01:39:27.460 --> 01:39:28.460
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: It is being implemented by the PNP themselves.

asr-001444
01:39:28.460 --> 01:39:35.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: By the PNP themselves. Thank you. Thank you for those answers.

asr-001445
01:39:38.040 --> 01:39:43.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: May isang policy question po ako, Chief PNP and to our DILG Secretary.

asr-001446
01:39:44.800 --> 01:39:53.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Over the past years, pag titignan ho natin yung mga surveys na lumalabas na Pulse Asia, SWS,

asr-001447
01:39:53.020 --> 01:39:57.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: ang criminality drugs, below top 5 na siya.

asr-001448
01:39:57.460 --> 01:40:02.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But slowly, umakit ang umakit. I'm sure you've seen the surveys.

asr-001449
01:40:03.460 --> 01:40:13.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And on the ground, whenever I go around rin sa Valenzuela, naririnig ko rin na lumalakas na yung loob na naman ng mga drug pusher,

asr-001450
01:40:13.180 --> 01:40:15.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: lumalakas yung loob ngayon ng mga petty criminals.

asr-001451
01:40:15.440 --> 01:40:27.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ano po yung mga programs natin on the ground to curb?

asr-001452
01:40:27.460 --> 01:40:33.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, ano po yung mga programs natin on the ground to curb?

asr-001453
01:40:33.460 --> 01:40:38.960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know, tinitignan ko, yung index crime, in fairness, bumababa, but we have to sustain it.

asr-001454
01:40:39.140 --> 01:40:50.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, what are the programs that the department and the agency is employing in order to sustain itong pagbaba ng mga index crimes?

asr-001455
01:40:51.220 --> 01:40:57.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the biggest tool that we can use is really the repealment of the Robin Padilla law.

asr-001456
01:40:57.460 --> 01:41:04.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have a list of the recalcitrant violators per barangay. We know who they are.

asr-001457
01:41:04.760 --> 01:41:11.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But it is a state policy, and I agree with the state policy, that EJKs are no longer allowed.

asr-001458
01:41:12.540 --> 01:41:18.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But knowing who these recalcitrant people are, and knowing that they're in possession of illegal firearms,

asr-001459
01:41:18.880 --> 01:41:25.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it would greatly help us in curbing criminality if we can arrest them and hold them without bail

asr-001460
01:41:25.460 --> 01:41:27.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because of the illegal firearms.

asr-001461
01:41:27.460 --> 01:41:37.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We estimate that these are 2 million at the high level, 1 million at the low level of illegal loose firearms on the roads, in the communities.

asr-001462
01:41:38.880 --> 01:41:44.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We estimate that there are 42,000 barangays. If we arrest 2 per barangay, that's 84,000.

asr-001463
01:41:45.400 --> 01:41:53.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But we estimate we will, if given that chance, we will arrest maybe up to 150,000 more criminals and take them off the streets.

asr-001464
01:41:53.600 --> 01:41:57.020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Sabi niya itong loose firearms.

asr-001465
01:41:57.460 --> 01:42:00.880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ito'y nagpapalakas ng loob ng mga criminals.

asr-001466
01:42:00.880 --> 01:42:08.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir. Kasi madala, sir, pag-bail, one week later, they'll commit another crime using another firearm. Marami silang taguan.

asr-001467
01:42:08.780 --> 01:42:21.440
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And how can we amend the law or repeal, if that matter, kung kailangan, in order to stop this, itong paikot-ikot na lang na criminality?

asr-001468
01:42:21.440 --> 01:42:27.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir. We have to repeal that law, sir, that was passed in 1995, if I believe.

asr-001469
01:42:27.460 --> 01:42:37.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think it was 1995 when illegal firearms became bailable. So we are asking that that law be repealed and make it non-bailable again.

asr-001470
01:42:37.940 --> 01:42:42.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So hindi na sila natatakot? Ibig sabihin mayroon siyang loose firearms? Alam naman nila makakabail sila.

asr-001471
01:42:42.960 --> 01:42:43.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001472
01:42:43.640 --> 01:42:45.060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pag-bail nila, balik ulit sa ano?

asr-001473
01:42:45.140 --> 01:42:45.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001474
01:42:45.520 --> 01:42:47.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Saan nila binibili itong mga loose firearms?

asr-001475
01:42:48.340 --> 01:42:55.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: San-san na lang, sir. May meron ang galing yung home industries na ginagawa dito sa Pilipinas.

asr-001476
01:42:55.520 --> 01:43:02.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Mayroon din yung mga lagi-import illegally through some portal zones of our coastlines.

asr-001477
01:43:03.400 --> 01:43:12.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But safe to say, sir, that if there are 2 million firearms on the loose right now, and 98% of the crimes are committed with these,

asr-001478
01:43:12.820 --> 01:43:19.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then we will grant an amnesty and determine whether these firearms were used in the commission of crimes.

asr-001479
01:43:19.820 --> 01:43:24.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But otherwise, sir, this repealment will greatly aid our nation.

asr-001480
01:43:25.520 --> 01:43:36.540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In terms of itong mga petty drugs, ako naririnig rin, naririnig ko rin sa mga punong barangay namin sa Valenzuela,

asr-001481
01:43:37.160 --> 01:43:42.140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na itong madaming petty drug dealings on the ground.

asr-001482
01:43:44.600 --> 01:43:49.180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ano bang mga plano ng agency to curb these petty drug dealings?

asr-001483
01:43:49.800 --> 01:43:51.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Actually, sir, if you look at the records,

asr-001484
01:43:51.900 --> 01:43:54.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the total consumption of the Philippines for...

asr-001485
01:43:55.520 --> 01:43:58.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: methamphetamine, hydrochloride, is 16 tons pure.

asr-001486
01:43:59.220 --> 01:44:01.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is then reduced to a...

asr-001487
01:44:01.740 --> 01:44:05.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: pilfered down to a lower number of maybe 15% purity at the end.

asr-001488
01:44:06.440 --> 01:44:12.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the last year, we have interdicted almost 11 tons, I think, of...

asr-001489
01:44:12.300 --> 01:44:18.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: or in 2 years, we've interdicted 11 tons of shabu, pure shabu, from the market.

asr-001490
01:44:18.340 --> 01:44:25.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That drove up the price of shabu, but now what they're doing is lowering the purity again to maybe 5 to 8%.

asr-001491
01:44:25.520 --> 01:44:37.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We find that the biggest consumers are in the transport sector, which we have to address also.

asr-001492
01:44:37.840 --> 01:44:46.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And a lot of them are true-want miners also, who roam the streets.

asr-001493
01:44:46.160 --> 01:44:53.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So I think with the Safer Cities initiative that we have a curfew on miners at 17 and below,

asr-001494
01:44:53.640 --> 01:44:55.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think it helped greatly.

asr-001495
01:44:55.520 --> 01:44:59.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I think the increased visibility of the police in the streets...

asr-001496
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:02.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: using the Safer City initiative is also helping.

asr-001497
01:45:03.480 --> 01:45:05.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No, this is a very complex problem.

asr-001498
01:45:05.420 --> 01:45:07.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And also,

asr-001499
01:45:08.200 --> 01:45:23.160
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: it's really a never-ending battle on the ground.

asr-001500
01:45:23.620 --> 01:45:27.620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And it's really a complex problem.

asr-001501
01:45:27.620 --> 01:45:31.280
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: However, we need to sustain the efforts

asr-001502
01:45:31.280 --> 01:45:33.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: because it affects everyone.

asr-001503
01:45:33.840 --> 01:45:34.460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Everyone, sir.

asr-001504
01:45:34.860 --> 01:45:40.100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And cascading to another crime

asr-001505
01:45:40.100 --> 01:45:41.420
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: is also a possibility.

asr-001506
01:45:42.180 --> 01:45:44.500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: If he's addicted, he'll hold up.

asr-001507
01:45:44.820 --> 01:45:47.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: If another crime happens.

asr-001508
01:45:47.400 --> 01:45:51.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you look at the statistics of the BGNP and the BUCAR,

asr-001509
01:45:51.960 --> 01:45:54.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 80% of the inmates inside the jails

asr-001510
01:45:54.420 --> 01:45:55.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: are all drug-related

asr-001511
01:45:55.780 --> 01:45:57.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if on the market,

asr-001512
01:45:57.620 --> 01:45:58.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the male population.

asr-001513
01:45:59.100 --> 01:46:00.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 80% are drug-related.

asr-001514
01:46:00.860 --> 01:46:02.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the female population,

asr-001515
01:46:03.100 --> 01:46:04.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: most of them are financial crimes.

asr-001516
01:46:05.700 --> 01:46:08.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we really have to address the problem

asr-001517
01:46:08.700 --> 01:46:10.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: with illegal drugs

asr-001518
01:46:10.140 --> 01:46:12.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because that is the cause of the congestion

asr-001519
01:46:12.060 --> 01:46:13.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of all our jails.

asr-001520
01:46:13.680 --> 01:46:16.080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We also correlated it with

asr-001521
01:46:16.080 --> 01:46:19.200
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: drug rehab facilities.

asr-001522
01:46:20.440 --> 01:46:21.680
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: For example,

asr-001523
01:46:21.920 --> 01:46:26.000
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: if we promote drug rehab facilities

asr-001524
01:46:26.000 --> 01:46:27.120
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: among LGUs,

asr-001525
01:46:27.620 --> 01:46:31.940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: they might be given a chance

asr-001526
01:46:31.940 --> 01:46:33.340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: to rehab themselves

asr-001527
01:46:33.340 --> 01:46:35.640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: instead of selling or entering.

asr-001528
01:46:35.880 --> 01:46:40.300
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Is that a worthwhile approach?

asr-001529
01:46:40.540 --> 01:46:41.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is, sir.

asr-001530
01:46:41.700 --> 01:46:44.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Especially if there is peer-to-peer counseling

asr-001531
01:46:44.120 --> 01:46:47.120
